  "description": "Emperor Lucardis, the dragon’s heir and guardian of the empire, suddenly visits Dyke, a retired knight who lived in peace with his daughter in a rural village after the war. There was a deep relationship between the two, but something seems to have happened! Meanwhile, the wheel of fate begins to flow in a new direction. A bittersweet and a little sexy love story between the young and charming wizard, Emperor Lucardis, and the slightly scary but upright knight, Dyke.",
